• User clicks "Use My Location" button
• Browser shows permission popup asking "Allow location access?"
• If allowed → browser reads GPS/WiFi/cell tower triangulation
• Returns latitude and longitude coordinates
• Those coordinates are saved to userLocation state
• The AI is then called with those coordinates to find nearby hospitals
